#: ../content/index.rst:208
msgid "Every valid Token needs to be mapped to a system user. If an API system user does not exist for an incoming webservice call, it will be created provided the Token passes validation, the Token contains roles, a corresponding Role Mapping exists, and the (optional) further restrictions you can configure in Otobo (see next section)."
msgstr ""

#: ../content/index.rst:211
msgid "Options to assure a System User can be mapped to from an access_token:"
